%% Lab 02: one tool-call round trip on Chat Completions, in five steps. The model only asks; our code runs the function.
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i lab02_tool_call_round_trip.mmd -o lab02_tool_call_round_trip.png -b white -s 2
sequenceDiagram
    participant Fn as Our function<br>(Python)
    participant Code as Our code
    participant API as Model<br>(Chat Completions)

    Code->>API: 1. messages + tools<br>(the tool schema)
    API-->>Code: 2. tool_calls: id, name,<br>arguments (a JSON string)
    Note over Code,API: our code decides whether to run it
    Code->>Fn: 3. run the function<br>with the arguments
    Fn-->>Code: the result (a Python value)
    Code->>API: 4. messages + the model's request<br>+ a tool message with the same id
    API-->>Code: 5. the answer, finish_reason "stop"
